#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:5
msgid "ADF41513 driver"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:7
msgid ""
"This driver supports Analog Devices' ADF41513 and similar SPI PLL frequency "
"synthesizers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:11
msgid "1. Supported devices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:13
msgid "`ADF41510 <https://www.analog.com/ADF41510>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:14
msgid "`ADF41513 <https://www.analog.com/ADF41513>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ADF41513 is an ultralow noise frequency synthesizer that can be used to "
"implement local oscillators (LOs) as high as 26.5 GHz in the upconversion "
"and downconversion sections of wireless receivers and transmitters. The "
"ADF41510 is a similar device that supports frequencies up to 10 GHz."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:21
msgid ""
"Both devices support integer-N and fractional-N operation modes, providing "
"excellent phase noise performance and flexible frequency generation "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:25
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:27
msgid "**ADF41510**: 1 GHz to 10 GHz frequency range"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:28
msgid "**ADF41513**: 1 GHz to 26.5 GHz frequency range"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:29
msgid "Integer-N and fractional-N operation modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:30
msgid "Ultra-low phase noise (-235 dBc/Hz integer-N, -231 dBc/Hz fractional-N)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:31
msgid "High maximum PFD frequency (250 MHz integer-N, 125 MHz fractional-N)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:32
msgid "25-bit fixed modulus or 49-bit variable modulus fractional modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:33
msgid "Programmable charge pump currents with 16x range"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:34
msgid "Digital lock detect functionality"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:35
msgid "Phase resync capability for consistent output phase"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:38
msgid "2. Device attributes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:40
msgid ""
"The ADF41513 driver provides the following IIO extended attributes for "
"frequency control and monitoring:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../iio/adf41513.rst:43
msgid ""
"Each IIO device has a device folder under ``/sys/bus/iio/devices/iio:"
"deviceX``, where X is the IIO index of the device. Under these folders "
"reside a set of device files that provide access to the synthesizer's "
"functionality."
msgstr ""

